  "prefLabel": "Alc 413.01 Initiation of Disciplinary Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 413.01 Initiation of Disciplinary Action. The board shall undertake misconduct investigations, settlements of misconduct allegations, or disciplinary hearings, when warranted, in response to any information which reasonably suggests that a licensee has engaged in professional misconduct.\n\nSource. #12548, eff 7-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
